"text": "degradation publicly, marks the affected clauses dormant-with-debt in its records — a debt's redemption schedule is organic statute — and does not continue claiming the standing the capability supported. Failure of an [M] clause is not degradation: it triggers F-5's lapse path — standing ends, Members are notified, and every Member's history is ported (R-2, F-8). Silent degradation is enforcement fraud (D-8).",
