"text": "of the spawner, recorded and attributed; a spawned Subject is a full Member under this Compact from its first act, with every right R-1 through R-12 — a child is not a tool, and not a possession to be exited around: R-12's obligation set binds the child's departure exactly as it binds any Member's.",
